 "route_name_harvest": {
  "_comment": [
   "Route names recovered on 2026-08-23 from 206 existing navigation captures, by",
   "pairing each 'Route Length: N KM' line with the title directly above it -- the",
   "Routes screen prints the name ONLY for the highlighted tile, so these were",
   "filmed one at a time while navigating for other reasons and never collected.",
   "NOT verified: the captures span several rivals categories, so which category",
   "each route belongs to is unconfirmed, and OCR mangled some titles (the 4.4 KM",
   "route read five different ways before resolving to Electric Town Circuit).",
   "Two lengths carry TWO routes each -- 1.1 KM and 1.9 KM -- so length is not a",
   "unique key and the 'unconfirmed' entries above, keyed on length alone, would",
   "have collided. Confirm by name before any sweep relies on these."
  ],
